# SPEC §10.2/§9.2: deny by default. The .vsix ships only the allowlist;
# everything else (src/, tests/, node_modules, dotfiles) stays out.
**/*
!dist/**
!resources/**
!README.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
# Pin the never-ship entries even though the catch-all above excludes them,
# so a future allowlist edit cannot silently re-include them.
src/**
tests/**
node_modules/**
**/.*
**/.DS_Store
